ChatGPT Response Notifier 0.5.0

This project uses the completion-monitoring implementation from ChatGPT Response Complete Notifier by Ram Haidar (ramhaidar/ChatGPT-Response-Complete-Notifier), revision cbe00dcfcff8a571f407c6109ed4d5f97cef60a9.

For version 0.5.0, extension/content-script.js remains byte-for-byte identical to the upstream file at that revision. The surrounding integration routes upstream completion events to this project's localhost Windows helper for persistent stacked notifications and managed updates without adding ChatGPT API polling. Separate local recovery and recent-notification-history layers use extension-local IndexedDB and existing browser/page events only.

